The following additions and documentation/metadata updates were made on top
of the upstream project and are NOT authored by Craft Docs Ltd.:

  business/agent-workbench/

      A multi-agent integration and governance layer. It contains a validated
      Agent Manifest registry; HTTP, Python and MCP execution adapters;
      explicit credential references; a local AES-GCM secret vault and
      Control Center; retry, rate-limit, quota and cost-estimate policies;
      privacy-preserving usage accounting; per-task artifact isolation;
      deterministic chapter fallback; result redaction/mapping; and account
      freeze / access revocation. It also contains the team directory and
      authenticated Agent Workbench API used by the optional team deployment.

  apps/electron/src/renderer/
  apps/webui/src/login.html
  packages/server/src/index.ts
  packages/server-core/src/webui/

      Minimal integration changes made for this derivative: a native Craft
      "AI 工作台" navigation route/page, account-login form fields, pluggable
      WebUI authentication, authenticated extension API routing, and optional
      team-mode server bootstrap. These changes are not authored by Craft Docs
      Ltd. and do not claim ownership of Craft's underlying runtime.

      The repository README and root package description were updated to
      describe this derivative work accurately.

The business directory adds one runtime dependency of its own. The above
apps/packages files were modified only for the documented UI/auth/API bridge.
